				{
					"id": 413370602,
					"content": "只有古華派弟子知道這個放燈的地方，可是我對你們沒有什麼印象…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413370603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芷若"
				},
				{
					"id": 413370603,
					"content": "我是代人來放燈的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413370604
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 413370604,
					"content": "還有古華派的人記得這裡嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413370605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芷若"
				},
				{
					"id": 413370605,
					"content": "我過來的時候看著這周圍寂寥無人，本來有些難過的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413370606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芷若"
				},
				{
					"id": 413370606,
					"content": "但現在知道還有古華派的人記得這裡，心裡反倒是好受了不少。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413370607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芷若"
				},
				{
					"id": 413370607,
					"content": "之前古華派會在這裡放燈？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413370608
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 413370608,
					"content": "嗯…那個時候都是編好霄燈後，師長領著我們過來，師長在前面走，我們捧著霄燈在後面跟著。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413370609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芷若"
				},
				{
					"id": 413370609,
					"content": "那時候…山上山下，霄燈連成一片，可好看了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413370610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芷若"
				},
				{
					"id": 413370610,
					"content": "可是現在…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413370611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芷若"
				},
				{
					"id": 413370611,
					"content": "…我們還是先把燈放起來吧，過去的事，如果不著急，我們可以邊走邊說。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "芷若"
				}
			]
		},
		{
