					"nextDialogs": [
						413370903
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芷若"
				},
				{
					"id": 413370903,
					"content": "但是，我現在也不知道我是不是真的在好好生活…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413370904
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芷若"
				},
				{
					"id": 413370904,
					"content": "又或者，我只不過是在得過且過罷了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413370905
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芷若"
				},
				{
					"id": 413370905,
					"content": "我聽人說，有一位叫孫宇的古華派門人正在訪仙，想要復興古華派。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413370906
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芷若"
				},
				{
					"id": 413370906,
					"content": "我要是有他這種勇氣的話…就好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413370907
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芷若"
				},
				{
					"id": 413370907,
					"content": "抱歉，一個人說了這麼多，難得到外面來透透氣，就是想多說一些話。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413370908
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芷若"
				},
				{
					"id": 413370908,
					"content": "妳好像有點難過。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413370909
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 413370909,
					"content": "我、我沒事，只不過每年過節的時候，都有點…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413370910
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芷若"
				},
				{
					"id": 413370910,
					"content": "#好了，時間也差不多了，祝你們海燈節快樂，也麻煩你代我向拜託{F#妳}{M#你}放燈的人帶句話，就說…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413370911
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芷若"
				},
				{
					"id": 413370911,
					"content": "就說…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413370912
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芷若"
				},
				{
					"id": 413370912,
					"content": "就說…芷若祝他海燈節快樂吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413370913
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芷若"
				},
				{
					"id": 413370913,
					"content": "也祝妳海燈節快樂。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413370914
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 413370914,
					"content": "#嗯，謝謝{F#妳}{M#你}，路上小心。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "芷若"
				}
			]
		},
